0..77 Comment "// The twin of `model/data/eta.gandr`: η reads a neutral as the tuple of its"
78..150 Comment "// own projections at their own positions, so a tuple of them in another"
151..224 Comment "// order, a record with its fields crossed, or the projections of another"
225..303 Comment "// neutral stay apart from it. η relates the unit to a neutral, but never two"
304..382 Comment "// neutrals of the unit type. η reads no grade, so it never takes the copy of"
383..405 Comment "// a linear parameter."
406..408 Comment "//"
409..423 Comment "// - see: #715"
424..439 Comment "// - see: #6110"
